```

Update integration tests to use reusable containers:

```java
@SpringBootTest
@Testcontainers
class OptimizedIntegrationTest {

    @Container
    static PostgreSQLContainer<?> postgres = new PostgreSQLContainer<>("postgres:14.2")
        .withReuse(true);  // Enable reuse

