|----------|---------------|------------|-------------|
| 1 test class | 12 seconds | 12 seconds | 0% (same) |
| 5 test classes (sequential) | 60 seconds | 20 seconds | 67% faster |
| 10 test classes (sequential) | 120 seconds | 28 seconds | 77% faster |
| 20 test classes (sequential) | 240 seconds | 44 seconds | 82% faster |

