- ✓ 15-20 services with Testcontainers integration tests
- ✓ Test execution time <15 minutes per service (container reuse optimization)
- ✓ Parallel test execution enabled (4 threads)
- ✓ Multi-container scenarios documented
- ✓ Best practices guide published

