### Example 4: Pharmacy Service Redis Cache Eviction Policy

**Scenario**: Redis Cache Eviction Policy Misconfigured; Production Memory Issues

**Problem**:
- **Unit Tests**: Mocked `RedisTemplate` has unlimited memory; no eviction policy testing
- **Production**: Redis configured with inadequate eviction policy; memory exhaustion causes cache failures

**With Testcontainers Integration Test** (Validates Cache Configuration):

```java
@SpringBootTest
@Testcontainers
class PharmacyCacheEvictionIntegrationTest {

    @Container
    static GenericContainer<?> redis = new GenericContainer<>("redis:7.0-alpine")
        .withExposedPorts(6379)
        .withCommand("redis-server", "--maxmemory", "50mb", "--maxmemory-policy", "allkeys-lru");

    @DynamicPropertySource
    static void redisProps(DynamicPropertyRegistry registry) {
        registry.add("spring.redis.host", redis::getHost);
        registry.add("spring.redis.port", redis::getFirstMappedPort);
    }

    @Autowired
    private DrugFormularyService formularyService;

    @Autowired
    private RedisTemplate<String, DrugFormulary> redisTemplate;

    @Test
    void shouldEvictLeastRecentlyUsedEntriesWhenMemoryFull() {
        // Fill cache with 1000 drug formulary entries (exceed 50MB limit)
        for (int i = 0; i < 1000; i++) {
            String ndc = "NDC-" + i;
            DrugFormulary formulary = new DrugFormulary(ndc, "Drug " + i, "Manufacturer");
            formularyService.cacheDrugFormulary(ndc, formulary);
        }

        // Verify older entries evicted (LRU policy)
        assertFalse(redisTemplate.hasKey("drug:NDC-0"), "Oldest entry should be evicted");
        assertTrue(redisTemplate.hasKey("drug:NDC-999"), "Newest entry should remain");

        // Verify cache still functional (not crashed from memory exhaustion)
        DrugFormulary retrieved = formularyService.getDrugFormulary("NDC-999");
        assertNotNull(retrieved);
    }
}
```

**Result**:
- **Cache Eviction Policy Validated**: LRU eviction working correctly under memory pressure
- **Production Deployment**: No Redis memory exhaustion; cache operates within limits
